@startuml organization-sub-boundary
title Organization / Sub-boundary Boundary ; per ADR-ES-022 section 12

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Organization" as Org
class "Team" as T
class "Department" as D
class "Business Unit" as BU

Org *-- T : contains (sub-boundary, deferred)
Org *-- D : contains (sub-boundary, deferred)
Org *-- BU : contains (sub-boundary, deferred)

note right
  Per ADR-ES-022 section 12, Team + Department + Business Unit
  are sub-boundaries within Organization, deferred. They are
  NOT established as foundational concepts by CR-ES-022.
end note

@enduml
